omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qsrULKkOppMQ7kNvwEGzLBo&_nc_oc=Adp8qKO_dGgZg0erlFukvVUejrHFZ0VF3CKTLRA2x7WXrFGbQYIDr7UWfcB0krd7rzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6wIzQ0tV6mA0E8-hBlkidqRTSpHP5wRzmuFslaJFzJ6A&oe=6A073A34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kWrEpw2co3UQ7kNvwHP-Qcl&_nc_oc=AdrlOQc9pbwt9SdS42XIFKOQVyVYjvwJaQdbqRL9hcKNTG5-u2XOauPAd2tLFi1D-m4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6O1fc6dsV0qjTe0nhtkGXxC-QQQQRfd6LQGhgNGm7pog&oe=6A073B96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FxOosb6EfIoQ7kNvwGiW7an&_nc_oc=AdoNuHkagIg4tjVBDq4k6KcJL-_mWImyjG7HfqqdXpyA-yw07KI2DHqcZTwGGkYRLGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5a1BcGqfxqzHJ5XAbqYvnZsROVI_ukqgOsKul7C6r0FA&oe=6A071877"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://